	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratia Christi tecum.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Tuę literę redditę sunt 7. augusti, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>quando iam pridie me primum e lectulo erexeram, in quo <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>sesquimensibus iacens graviter laboravi, adeo ut princeps <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ipse atque duo physici actum de vita putabant.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Nam morbus <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>omnium mortalium operam luserat.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Domina a <placeName ref="l404">Rapoltstein</placeName> bis <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>me visitans sua quoque industria multa adhibuit <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>pharmaca, sed frustra.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Tandem ille benignus deus me <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>sua solita clementia ex improviso respexit et malu, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>quod me adeo inclementer torserat, sua gratia mitiga<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>vit; respiro nunc utcunque etc.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Fiat domini voluntas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Totum corpus fuerat inflammatione ita accensum, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ut medici desperarent incendium posse extingui, totus <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ardebam etc.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Fratres reliqui recte valent hodieque <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>viciniores me visitantes te amice resalutant.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Bene <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>fecisti, quod <persName ref="p8111">Martyrem</persName> evocaris ex <placeName ref="l491">Argentina</placeName>; <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>indigni fuerunt tanto viro, neque superciliosus ille <lb xml:id="p1z17"/><persName>Marckbachius</persName>, qui imperiose illic agit, potuisset illum <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>diutius ferre.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Princeps noster ante mensem e <lb xml:id="p1z19"/><placeName ref="l327">Montbelgardo</placeName> solvens cum uxore gravida huc venit <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>recreationis ergo voluitque redire post aliquot dies <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>redire in nidum Montbelgardianum, ut uxor ilhic <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>pareret.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">At mulier erravit numerando putans adhuc <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>superesse mensem pariendi, et dum agunt <placeName>Argentuarię</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>subito dolore partus angitur atque fęliciter uterum eva<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>cuans peperit elegantissimum principem nomine <persName>Ulrichum</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>qui superiori heptomada baptisatus, atque ad hoc festum vocavit <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>princeps omnes concionatores atque ditionis omnes <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>proceres, vicinos Colmarienses <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>item et nobiles viciniores; compatres fuere dominus <lb xml:id="p1z30"/><persName>Philippus</persName> a <placeName ref="l2313">Hanau</placeName> et comes ab <placeName>Erdbach</placeName>, vir valde <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>doctus in omnibus disciplinis, et praefectus imperialium <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>urbium in <placeName ref="l632">Alsatia</placeName>; - sedem habet <placeName>Haganoę</placeName>, - conmater <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>relicta vidua domini <persName ref="p8034">a Heideck</persName> filia dominę a <placeName ref="l404">Rapolt<lb xml:id="p1z34"/>stein</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>fuitque ea, ut dicunt, omnibus celebris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la">Ego principi fęliciter <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>precatus per doctorem <persName>Alexandrum</persName> physicum iussi, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ut hęc verba diceret:</foreign> "Ich wunsch ieren gnaden gluck <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>und heil zum jungen und bitte got, das er frommer <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>werde dan der vatter und alle <placeName ref="l572">Wirtenberger</placeName>."</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">At <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>illum subrisisse ait, tamen et gratias egisse seque idem optare.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/>Quod <persName ref="p974">Molinaeus</persName> aliquamdiu per principem vinctus <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>fuit, breviter exponam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Contendit princeps cum principe <lb xml:id="p2z8"/><placeName ref="l631">Burgundionum</placeName> aut <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinando</persName> pro ditione et domi<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>nio cuiusdam regionis non procul a <placeName ref="l327">Montbelgart</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>quod olim vi abstulerint, atque ee cause apud <placeName>Dol<lb xml:id="p2z11"/>am</placeName> aguntur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Usus est ergo princeps consilio <lb xml:id="p2z12"/><persName ref="p974">Molinaei</persName> in ea causa; at ille omnes consultationes, forte <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>pecunia corruptus, Dole iudicibus manifestavit.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Fuerunt <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>enim schedę et autographa illius intercepta.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Consilio <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>igitur ducis <persName ref="p1227">Christophori</persName> in vincula coniectus est, et <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>tamen post aliquot dies liberatus receptusque in gratiam <lb xml:id="p2z17"/><foreign xml:lang="de">hat er geschworen ein urfeh.</foreign></s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Venit ad illum <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>ex <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> uxor cum pueris, quae et benigniter recepti.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z19"/>Tandem, dum minime sperabatur, omnes fuga elapsi sunt.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z20"/>Quo angulo orbis se contineat, ignoratur.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Certe mul<lb xml:id="p2z21"/>tum incomodavit principi in causa litis etc.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Haec <lb xml:id="p2z22"/>breviter ad te tremula manu.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Alias, dum melius <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>habuero, plura.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Ora dominum pro me, frater in Christo <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>observandissime cum tuis fratribus.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><persName ref="p8011">Gualterum</persName>, <persName ref="p8171">Bibliandru<lb xml:id="p2z25"/>m</persName> ac reliquos saluta etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l411">Richenvillę</placeName> 7. au<lb xml:id="p2z26"/>gusti 1556.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z27"/>Tuus <lb xml:id="p2z28"/><persName ref="p1010">Erbius</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z29"/>ille aegrotus sub <lb xml:id="p2z31"/>benigni dei ferula.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Melius non <lb xml:id="p2z32"/>potui scribere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z33"/>Literas ad filium curabimus <lb xml:id="p2z34"/>ut secure certoque per<lb xml:id="p2z35"/>ferantur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Eximio viro pietate inprimis <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>ac eruditione domino <lb xml:id="p4z3"/><persName ref="p495">Henrycho Bullingero</persName>, inclytae <lb xml:id="p4z4"/>urbis <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiorum</placeName> <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> <lb xml:id="p4z5"/>antistiti et theologo, suo <lb xml:id="p4z6"/>domino observando etc.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
